"outputs/fdef9137-9e39-4b05-afa9-9091766053f6-0.avif)\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "X gate {#x-gate}"
msgstr "Puerta X {#x-gate}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The X gate is a $\\pi$ rotation around the $x$ axis of the Bloch sphere.\n"
"Applying the X gate to $|0\\rangle$ results in $|1\\rangle$, and applying the X gate to $|1\\rangle$ results in $|0\\rangle$, so it is an operation similar to the classical NOT gate, and is also known as bit flip. The matrix representation of the X gate is below.\n"
msgstr ""
"La puerta X es una rotación de $\\pi$ alrededor del eje $x$ de la esfera de Bloch.\n"
"Aplicar la puerta X a $|0\\rangle$ produce $|1\\rangle$, y aplicar la puerta X a $|1\\rangle$ produce $|0\\rangle$, por lo que es una operación similar a la puerta clásica NOT y también se conoce como inversión de bit. La representación matricial de la puerta X se muestra a continuación.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"X = \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"0 & 1 \\\\\n"
"1 & 0 \\\\\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"X = \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"0 & 1 \\\\\n"
"1 & 0 \\\\\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-"
"quantum-computing/bits-gates-and-circuits/extracted-"
"outputs/b3468430-0cbc-44ab-bd21-901436662a4b-0.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-"
"quantum-computing/bits-gates-and-circuits/extracted-"
"outputs/b3468430-0cbc-44ab-bd21-901436662a4b-0.avif)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In IBM Quantum&reg;, the initial state is set to $|0\\rangle$, so the "
"quantum circuit above in matrix representation is\n"
msgstr ""
"En IBM Quantum&reg;, el estado inicial está establecido en $|0\\rangle$, por"
" lo que el circuito cuántico anterior en representación matricial es\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"X|0\\rangle=  \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"0 & 1 \\\\\n"
"1 & 0\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"1 \\\\ 0\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
" =\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"0 \\\\ 1\n"
"\\end{pmatrix} = |1\\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"X|0\\rangle=  \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"0 & 1 \\\\\n"
"1 & 0\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"1 \\\\ 0\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
" =\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"0 \\\\ 1\n"
"\\end{pmatrix} = |1\\rangle\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Next, let's run this circuit using a statevector simulator.\n"
msgstr ""
"A continuación, ejecutamos este circuito con un simulador de vector de "
"estado.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-"
"quantum-computing/bits-gates-and-circuits/extracted-"
"outputs/efb727e8-f51e-4903-aa0f-e4c099316815-1.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-"
"quantum-computing/bits-gates-and-circuits/extracted-"
"outputs/efb727e8-f51e-4903-aa0f-e4c099316815-1.avif)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Vertical vector is displayed as row vector, with complex numbers (the "
"imaginary part is indexed by $j$ ).\n"
msgstr ""
"El vector vertical se muestra como un vector fila, con números complejos (la"
" parte imaginaria se indica con $j$).\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "H gate {#h-gate}"
msgstr "Puerta H {#h-gate}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The Hadamard gate is a $\\pi$ rotation around an axis halfway between the "
"$x$ and $z$ axes on the Bloch sphere. Applying the H gate to $|0\\rangle$ "
"creates a superposition state such as $\\frac{|0\\rangle + "
"|1\\rangle}{\\sqrt{2}}$. The matrix representation of the H gate is below.\n"
msgstr ""
"La puerta Hadamard es una rotación de $\\pi$ alrededor de un eje a medio "
"camino entre los ejes $x$ y $z$ en la esfera de Bloch. Aplicar la puerta H a"
" $|0\\rangle$ produce un estado de superposición como $\\frac{|0\\rangle + "
"|1\\rangle}{\\sqrt{2}}$. La representación matricial de la puerta H se "
"muestra a continuación.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"H = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"1 & 1 \\\\\n"
"1 & -1 \\\\\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"H = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"1 & 1 \\\\\n"
"1 & -1 \\\\\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-"
"quantum-computing/bits-gates-and-circuits/extracted-"
"outputs/574c35f0-26a9-423a-8d65-7140ba7398e3-0.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-"
"quantum-computing/bits-gates-and-circuits/extracted-"
"outputs/574c35f0-26a9-423a-8d65-7140ba7398e3-0.avif)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-"
"quantum-computing/bits-gates-and-circuits/extracted-"
"outputs/7adf0e93-6db3-4aa8-800f-c91c8cc46001-1.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-"
"quantum-computing/bits-gates-and-circuits/extracted-"
"outputs/7adf0e93-6db3-4aa8-800f-c91c8cc46001-1.avif)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This is\n"
"$$\n"
"H|0\\rangle= \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"1 & 1 \\\\\n"
"1 & -1\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"1 \\\\0\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
" =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"1 \\\\\n"
"1\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"=\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"0.707 \\\\\n"
"0.707\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}(|0\\rangle+|1\\rangle)\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"Esto es\n"
"$$\n"
"H|0\\rangle= \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"1 & 1 \\\\\n"
"1 & -1\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"1 \\\\0\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
" =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"1 \\\\\n"
"1\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"=\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"0.707 \\\\\n"
"0.707\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}(|0\\rangle+|1\\rangle)\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This superposition state is so common and important, that it is given its "
"own symbol:\n"
msgstr ""
"Este estado de superposición es tan frecuente e importante que tiene su "
"propio símbolo:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"|+\\rangle \\equiv \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}(|0\\rangle+|1\\rangle).\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"|+\\rangle \\equiv \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}(|0\\rangle+|1\\rangle).\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"By applying the $H$ gate on the $|0\\rangle$, we created a superposition of "
"$|0\\rangle$ and $|1\\rangle$ where measurement in the computational basis "
"(along z in the Bloch sphere picture) would give you each state with equal "
"probabilities.\n"
msgstr ""
"Al aplicar la puerta $H$ a $|0\\rangle$, hemos creado una superposición de "
"$|0\\rangle$ y $|1\\rangle$, donde una medición en la base computacional (a "
"lo largo de z en la imagen de la esfera de Bloch) produce cada estado con "
"igual probabilidad.\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "$|-\\rangle$ state {#rangle-state}"
msgstr "Estado $|-\\rangle$ {#rangle-state}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You might have guessed that there is a corresponding  $|-\\rangle$ state:\n"
"$$\n"
"|-\\rangle \\equiv \\frac{|0\\rangle -|1\\rangle}{\\sqrt{2}}.\n"
"$$\n"
"To create this state, first apply an X gate to make $|1\\rangle$, then apply an H gate.\n"
msgstr ""
"Quizás hayas adivinado que existe un estado $|-\\rangle$ correspondiente:\n"
"$$\n"
"|-\\rangle \\equiv \\frac{|0\\rangle -|1\\rangle}{\\sqrt{2}}.\n"
"$$\n"
"Para crear este estado, aplica primero una puerta X para obtener $|1\\rangle$, y luego una puerta H.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-"
"quantum-computing/bits-gates-and-circuits/extracted-"
"outputs/b8e96fc4-6708-415e-b8fc-ac69eaeae750-0.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
