"gate-and-entanglement}"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "4.1 Multi-qubit quantum circuit {#41-multi-qubit-quantum-circuit}"
msgstr "4.1 Circuito cuántico multi-qubit {#41-multi-qubit-quantum-circuit}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We can create a two-qubit quantum circuit with following code. We will apply"
" an H gate to each qubit.\n"
msgstr ""
"Podemos crear un circuito cuántico de dos qubits con el siguiente código. "
"Aplicaremos una puerta H a cada qubit.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-"
"quantum-computing/bits-gates-and-circuits/extracted-"
"outputs/e880f7eb-108c-4387-8ef4-97219fd5691c-0.avif)\n"
