"quantum-computing/bits-gates-and-circuits/extracted-"
"outputs/ebdf591f-18d0-4fd1-a3a3-b1cdac13bd97-0.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-"
"quantum-computing/bits-gates-and-circuits/extracted-"
"outputs/ebdf591f-18d0-4fd1-a3a3-b1cdac13bd97-0.avif)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Next, let's measure this circuit.\n"
msgstr "A continuación, medimos este circuito.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
