#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "4.2 Multi-qubit quantum gates {#42-multi-qubit-quantum-gates}"
msgstr "4.2 Puertas cuánticas multi-qubit {#42-multi-qubit-quantum-gates}"

#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "CNOT gate {#cnot-gate}"
msgstr "Puerta CNOT {#cnot-gate}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A CNOT(\"controlled NOT\" or CX) gate is a two-qubit gate, meaning its "
"action involves two qubits at once: the control qubit and the target qubit. "
"A CNOT flips the target qubit only when the control qubit is $|1\\rangle$.\n"
msgstr ""
"Una puerta CNOT (\"controlled NOT\" o CX) es una puerta de dos qubits cuya "
"acción involucra dos qubits simultáneamente: el qubit de control y el qubit "
"objetivo. Una CNOT invierte el qubit objetivo solo cuando el qubit de "
"control es $|1\\rangle$.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Input (target,control) | Output (target,control) |\n"
"|:-----------:|:------------:|\n"
"| 00          | 00           |\n"
"| 01          | 11           |\n"
"| 10          | 10           |\n"
"| 11          | 01           |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Entrada (Objetivo,Control) | Salida (Objetivo,Control) |\n"
"|:-----------:|:------------:|\n"
"| 00          | 00           |\n"
"| 01          | 11           |\n"
"| 10          | 10           |\n"
"| 11          | 01           |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Let us first simulate the action of this two-qubit gate when q0 and q1 are "
"both $|0\\rangle$, and obtain the output statevector. The Qiskit syntax used"
" is ```qc.cx(control qubit, target qubit)```.\n"
msgstr ""
"Primero simulemos el efecto de esta puerta de dos qubits cuando q0 y q1 son "
"ambos $|0\\rangle$, y obtengamos el vector de estado de salida. La sintaxis "
"de Qiskit utilizada es ```qc.cx(control qubit, target qubit)```.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-"
"quantum-computing/bits-gates-and-circuits/extracted-outputs/a5621efd-"
"dd9f-4ea4-bf3a-be3cacb45287-0.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-"
"quantum-computing/bits-gates-and-circuits/extracted-outputs/a5621efd-"
"dd9f-4ea4-bf3a-be3cacb45287-0.avif)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"As expected, applying a CNOT gate on $|00\\rangle$ did not change the state, since the control qubit was in the $|0\\rangle$ state.\n"
"Let's get back to our CNOT operation. This time we will apply a CNOT gate to $|01\\rangle$ and see what happens.\n"
msgstr ""
"Como se esperaba, aplicar una puerta CNOT a $|00\\rangle$ no cambió el estado, ya que el qubit de control estaba en el estado $|0\\rangle$.\n"
"Volvamos a nuestra operación CNOT. Esta vez aplicamos una puerta CNOT a $|01\\rangle$ y veamos qué sucede.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-"
"quantum-computing/bits-gates-and-circuits/extracted-"
"outputs/5a02de82-44ff-40eb-b64c-2389d6eae3ee-0.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-"
"quantum-computing/bits-gates-and-circuits/extracted-"
"outputs/5a02de82-44ff-40eb-b64c-2389d6eae3ee-0.avif)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"By applying a CNOT gate, the $|01\\rangle$ state has now become "
"$|11\\rangle$.\n"
msgstr ""
"Al aplicar una puerta CNOT, el estado $|01\\rangle$ se ha convertido en "
"$|11\\rangle$.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Let us verify these results by running the circuit on a simulator.\n"
msgstr "Verifiquemos estos resultados ejecutando el circuito en un simulador.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
